<!-- FAQ -->
<section id="faq" class="relative py-24 lg:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-14" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="inline-block text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-teal-300 mb-3">FAQ</div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Frequently asked <span class="text-gradient">questions</span></h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg">Honest answers about how AI CallHub works today.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <details class="glass rounded-xl group" data-aos="fade-up">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">How realistic are the AI voices?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Our voices are powered by ElevenLabs and fine-tuned so they sound natural in real conversations. Agents support emotion modulation, natural pauses, and interruption handling — give the live demo a call to hear it yourself.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="50">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">What languages do you support?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">The voice engine supports 40+ languages including English, Spanish, French, German, Portuguese, Japanese, Mandarin, Arabic, and Hindi. You select a language and voice when you create an agent.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">Is my data secure?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">We take security seriously. Connections are protected with HTTPS/TLS, passwords are hashed with bcrypt, and only authorized users can access their own call data. Formal certifications such as SOC 2 and GDPR are on our roadmap as the product grows — see the <a href="/security" class="text-teal-300 underline underline-offset-2">Security page</a> for details.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">How long does setup take?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">You can go from sign-up to a test call in your account the same day: create an account, add your business knowledge, create an agent, and try the live demo in the browser.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">Can I transfer calls to a human?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">The platform is designed to hand complex conversations to a human agent with full context. In the current early-access version the live demo showcases fully automated conversations — direct telephony hand-off is in development.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="250">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">What does it cost?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">During 2026 early access, everything is free — no credit card required. The plans on the Pricing section show our launch roadmap for when paid plans arrive.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">Do I get a real phone number?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Today, calls happen in-browser through our live demo (voice + text). Dedicated phone numbers in your own country are on the roadmap.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="350">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">Can I train the agent on my business?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes. Upload PDFs, documents, FAQs, policies, or product lists to the knowledge base, and the agent answers from that content — so it talks about your business, not generic chatbot lines.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">Can I use my own voice?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Voice cloning is available on the Professional plan — clone your own voice with a short sample, or pick from premium built-in voices.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="450">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">How accurate is the transcription?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Transcription quality depends on the caller's audio quality and accent. Every call is recorded and transcribed so you can review summaries, sentiment, and lead scores afterward.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="500">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">How long does API integration take?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">We're building documented REST + webhook APIs. For simple flows (send call summaries to your own system), most teams connect within a few days. We'll also help you integrate by hand where the docs don't cover it yet.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="550">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">How does data backup work?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Your calls, transcripts, notes, and agents are stored in our managed MongoDB cloud database, which keeps automated backups. You can export your records from the dashboard anytime.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="600">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">What's the cancellation policy?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Cancel anytime from your dashboard in one click. No contracts, no cancellation fees. Your data stays exportable for 30 days after cancellation.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="650">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">How is this different from a classic IVR?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">IVRs force callers to press buttons through menus. AI CallHub understands free-form speech — a caller can say "I need to reschedule my Tuesday appointment and check my bill," and the agent handles both naturally.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="700">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">Do you offer a free trial?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes — early access is free for the whole of 2026. Create an account, build an agent, and run a live test call. No credit card needed.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="glass rounded-xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="750">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-5 py-4">
          <span class="font-semibold">Who can see my call data?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 faq-chevron flex-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Only the account owner and teammates you explicitly add. Calls, transcripts, and agent configs are scoped to your account and never shared with other users.</div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mt-10" data-aos="fade-up">
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Still have questions?</p>
      <a href="#contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-teal-300 hover:text-teal-200 transition mt-1">
        Ask us anything
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>